1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,420
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,370
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:16,100
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,260
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,250
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,500
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,770
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,730
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,730
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:45,100
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:48,090
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,940
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,290
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,460
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,540
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,420
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,860
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,300
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,380
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,500
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,460
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:33,100
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,730
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,730
Main Road
Country of Zhao

25
00:01:55,920 --> 00:01:58,650
Liu San
Wei Wu Mercenary Agency

26
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,730
We made it through safely

27
00:01:58,520 --> 00:02:00,720
thanks to you, Chief.

28
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:01,890
Yang Sen
Wei Wu Mercenary Agency

29
00:02:02,440 --> 00:02:03,840
Chief,

30
00:02:04,280 --> 00:02:07,680
we are escorting a valuable shipment this time.

31
00:02:07,440 --> 00:02:10,320
We should be getting a 10% cut, right ?

32
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:10,850
Du Feng
Wei Wu Mercenary Agency

33
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,810
The Boss has always been fair

34
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:14,560
as long as we complete the delivery.

35
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:17,440
We’re only 4 days away from Tianshui City now.

36
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:18,400
Stay focused !

37
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:19,480
Got it !

38
00:02:26,960 --> 00:02:28,800
Yang Sen, go check it out.

39
00:02:29,160 --> 00:02:30,170
Okay.

40
00:02:39,680 --> 00:02:41,570
Young man, you’ve got guts.

41
00:02:41,440 --> 00:02:44,010
I’m Yang Sen from the Wei Wu Mercenary Agency.

42
00:02:43,840 --> 00:02:46,290
Why are you walking the Main Road alone ?

43
00:02:46,080 --> 00:02:47,770
Do you need help ?

44
00:02:47,560 --> 00:02:49,130
My name is Wang Lin,

45
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,320
I'm a woodcarver.

46
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,810
I’m heading to Tianshui City to make a living

47
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,720
but I’m lost.

48
00:02:53,640 --> 00:02:56,530
Could you tell me how to get to Tianshui City ?

49
00:02:56,480 --> 00:02:59,120
What a coincidence, we’re also going to Tianshui City.

50
00:02:58,880 --> 00:03:00,890
You can come with us.

51
00:03:01,200 --> 00:03:02,400
Thank you very much.

52
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:36,360
Senior,

53
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:39,320
I finished inscribing this jade tablet as you taught me.

54
00:03:39,600 --> 00:03:42,120
Good. After refining it,

55
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:44,440
this jade talisman has become a Core Formation artifact.

56
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,240
A Core Formation artifact ?

57
00:03:45,200 --> 00:03:47,160
Yes, a Core Formation artifact,

58
00:03:47,400 --> 00:03:51,050
an artifact with the power of a Core Formation cultivator.

59
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:53,200
That Sun Dazhu was such a fool,

60
00:03:53,240 --> 00:03:56,570
he had good artifacts but didn't know how to refine them.

61
00:03:56,440 --> 00:03:58,600
If not for my knowledge,

62
00:03:58,560 --> 00:04:02,120
these artifacts would have been wasted.

63
00:04:03,720 --> 00:04:04,560
Senior,

64
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:07,250
I'm already at the peak of Qi Condensation.

65
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:08,440
If I go to Tianshui City

66
00:04:08,200 --> 00:04:10,400
and find some wood element materials

67
00:04:10,160 --> 00:04:12,170
to upgrade the Heaven Defying Bead,

68
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:14,730
will I be able to reach Foundation Establishment ?

69
00:04:14,560 --> 00:04:15,680
Not yet.

70
00:04:16,640 --> 00:04:18,330
How long will it take ?

71
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,520
How long ?

72
00:04:19,440 --> 00:04:20,880
You blockhead !

73
00:04:21,080 --> 00:04:22,960
If you think this method is too slow,

74
00:04:22,730 --> 00:04:24,170
then listen to me

75
00:04:23,960 --> 00:04:25,650
and steal a Foundation.

76
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:26,730
Senior...

77
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:30,330
I don't think I can capture a Foundation Establishment cultivator alive.

78
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,250
And even if I did,

79
00:04:32,200 --> 00:04:34,800
that person would die without a doubt.

80
00:04:35,400 --> 00:04:37,090
Foundation Stealing

81
00:04:36,960 --> 00:04:38,880
is a bit too cruel for me.

82
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:41,120
It's the law of the jungle,

83
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:43,570
harming others for your own benefit is natural !

84
00:04:43,640 --> 00:04:45,330
With your mindset,

85
00:04:45,080 --> 00:04:47,330
you’ll suffer sooner or later.

86
00:04:52,080 --> 00:04:54,040
Brother Wang arrived at the right time.

87
00:04:53,810 --> 00:04:56,770
Today is the day Mister Li is reading our fortunes.

88
00:04:55,080 --> 00:04:57,530
Mister Li
Wei Wu Mercenary Agency

89
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:59,320
You’re really lucky,

90
00:04:59,240 --> 00:05:01,320
Mister Li is a living Immortal.

91
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:05,080
Fine,

92
00:05:05,280 --> 00:05:08,120
I’ll read your fortunes today.

93
00:05:08,360 --> 00:05:09,850
Thank you, sir.

94
00:05:15,600 --> 00:05:17,960
Dark clouds loom over you,

95
00:05:18,200 --> 00:05:20,360
you will be part of a bloodshed.

96
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:23,090
This calamity is imminent,

97
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:24,530
but if you can survive it

98
00:05:24,280 --> 00:05:27,810
you’ll have a romantic encounter within 3 months.

99
00:05:28,240 --> 00:05:31,520
As a mercenary, I'm always in danger.

100
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:33,000
Being in bloodsheds

101
00:05:32,800 --> 00:05:34,080
is inevitable.

102
00:05:35,840 --> 00:05:36,930
Weird...

103
00:05:36,720 --> 00:05:38,880
Why are you also part of a bloodshed ?

104
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:44,850
Old Liu, you too have bloodshed in your fortune !

105
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:49,080
This...

106
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:49,920
This...

107
00:05:50,400 --> 00:05:53,000
Everyone here has signs of a bloodshed.

108
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,720
This doesn’t look good !

109
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:04,930
You...

110
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,850
Senior...

111
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:09,810
Mister, does he also have a bloodshed in his fortune ?

112
00:06:09,610 --> 00:06:11,690
It has nothing to do with this young man

113
00:06:11,440 --> 00:06:14,120
but my fortune-telling skills might be lacking...

114
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,210
I can’t see through him.

115
00:06:16,040 --> 00:06:17,490
I can’t see through him.

116
00:06:17,280 --> 00:06:20,120
This Junior's fortune-telling is interesting.

117
00:06:20,040 --> 00:06:22,920
I sent him memories of me killing people.

118
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,920
Who is here !?

119
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,720
Show your face at once !

120
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:42,160
Mister Liu San,

121
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:44,000
hand over the ginseng

122
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,800
and we won't hurt anyone !

123
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:46,730
Song Xing
Mortal

124
00:06:47,240 --> 00:06:49,520
Song Xing, you are pathetic.

125
00:06:49,920 --> 00:06:52,490
Let’s see who won’t leave alive !

126
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:02,360
Immortal... an Immortal spell !

127
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,850
Hand over the ginseng,

128
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,960
or you will die.

129
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:11,640
Zhang Hu ?

130
00:07:12,720 --> 00:07:15,000
Old Liu, just hand it over.

131
00:07:15,120 --> 00:07:18,360
How can mortals like us resist an Immortal ?

132
00:07:18,720 --> 00:07:22,160
The boss won’t blame us.

133
00:07:28,120 --> 00:07:29,160
Bold of you !

134
00:07:40,080 --> 00:07:41,310
You...

135
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,720
You’re actually an Immortal !

136
00:07:44,800 --> 00:07:46,890
You're meeting an old friend

137
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:49,290
yet you won’t you come out and greet me ?

138
00:07:58,640 --> 00:08:00,600
Greetings, Boss !

139
00:08:01,560 --> 00:08:03,250
Who are you ?

140
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,640
Hand over the ginseng if you know what’s good for you.

141
00:08:05,520 --> 00:08:07,010
Otherwise,

142
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:08,970
don’t blame me for being ruthless.

143
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,970
Something's wrong...

144
00:08:15,200 --> 00:08:16,690
My bad,

145
00:08:16,680 --> 00:08:18,730
I mistook you for someone else.

146
00:08:19,760 --> 00:08:21,530
You’re a smart one.

147
00:08:21,760 --> 00:08:23,650
Now get lost !

148
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,360
Greetings, Immortal !

149
00:08:40,160 --> 00:08:42,690
Bai Zhan
Rogue cultivator
15th layer of Qi Condensation

150
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,760
Master.

151
00:08:56,280 --> 00:08:59,680
Immortal, please spare us.

152
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:02,080
He's at the peak of Qi Condensation.

153
00:09:02,520 --> 00:09:04,000
The same level as you.

154
00:09:04,440 --> 00:09:05,410
Perfect,

155
00:09:05,160 --> 00:09:06,240
Little Lin,

156
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:09,400
it's a good opportunity to try out your new artifacts.

157
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,200
Zhang Hu,

158
00:09:22,400 --> 00:09:24,320
why don't you greet

159
00:09:24,440 --> 00:09:26,840
this old friend of yours.

160
00:09:27,520 --> 00:09:28,320
Master,

161
00:09:28,400 --> 00:09:30,690
disciple doesn’t know this person.

162
00:09:31,080 --> 00:09:32,200
Good.

163
00:09:31,960 --> 00:09:34,440
8th layer of Qi Condensation...

164
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:36,040
If I can drink his blood

165
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:39,080
it will surely boost my cultivation.

166
00:09:39,120 --> 00:09:40,400
I’ll help you, Master.

167
00:09:44,280 --> 00:09:45,320
Master...

168
00:09:47,480 --> 00:09:48,520
Did you think

169
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:50,640
I didn't see that speed talisman !?

170
00:09:55,560 --> 00:09:56,600
Master !

171
00:09:57,640 --> 00:09:59,770
This person is a friend of mine.

172
00:09:59,560 --> 00:10:00,600
Please...

173
00:10:00,960 --> 00:10:02,240
please spare him !

174
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:10,400
So you were trying to help him escape ?

175
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:13,920
You overestimate yourself.

176
00:10:14,600 --> 00:10:15,880
This guy

177
00:10:15,760 --> 00:10:18,400
probably used a control poison on Zhang Hu.

178
00:10:49,720 --> 00:10:51,960
You’re not at the 8th layer !

179
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,450
Even if you're Foundation Establishment,

180
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:58,760
you won’t escape this flying sword !

181
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:07,290
Such a fast sword !

182
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,530
This flying sword is strange.

183
00:11:09,280 --> 00:11:11,320
Little Lin, be careful !

184
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:44,080
This... this is a Core Formation artifact !

185
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:50,240
I am Old Man Ji Mo's disciple !

186
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:07,050
This kind of life or death battle

187
00:12:06,840 --> 00:12:09,080
is perfect to temper you.

188
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,080
Only then

189
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:15,080
can you see the true nature of the cultivation world.

190
00:12:24,960 --> 00:12:26,240
He’s dead...

191
00:12:27,360 --> 00:12:29,130
Was it because of him

192
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:31,250
that you didn't acknowledge me earlier ?

193
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,050
He’s really dead !

194
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:40,160
Wang Lin,

195
00:12:39,920 --> 00:12:41,520
this isn’t the place to talk.

196
00:12:41,320 --> 00:12:42,760
We can catch up

197
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,090
after we dispose of them.

198
00:12:48,160 --> 00:12:49,920
Dead persons won't talk !

199
00:12:50,200 --> 00:12:52,450
Bai Zhan is Old Man Ji Mo's disciple,

200
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,210
he'll investigate this matter !

201
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:55,280
If he does,

202
00:12:55,200 --> 00:12:57,210
we won't be able to escape death !

203
00:12:57,080 --> 00:12:59,010
Exalted Immortals,

204
00:12:58,960 --> 00:13:02,400
we swear we won’t say a word.

205
00:13:02,800 --> 00:13:04,290
You won't ?

206
00:13:05,200 --> 00:13:07,810
But if someone extracts your soul and refines it,

207
00:13:07,560 --> 00:13:10,400
they will know everything.

208
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:28,360
I erased their memories of tonight.

209
00:13:29,440 --> 00:13:30,480
Let’s go.

210
00:13:34,920 --> 00:13:36,570
It’s been many years

211
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:38,080
since we parted at Heng Yue Sect.

212
00:13:40,800 --> 00:13:43,170
After you left the Heng Yue Sect,

213
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:45,890
I had no one else to drink with.

214
00:13:47,520 --> 00:13:49,170
Same here...

215
00:13:52,160 --> 00:13:53,800
I need to find a safe place

216
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:56,520
to refine this flying sword into my artifact.

217
00:13:56,880 --> 00:13:58,570
If we need to fight,

218
00:13:58,600 --> 00:14:00,450
it will increase our chances.

219
00:14:00,640 --> 00:14:01,680
Perfect.

220
00:14:01,840 --> 00:14:04,440
I was planning to lay low in the nearby Teng Family City.

221
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,520
Let’s go together.

222
00:14:05,560 --> 00:14:08,200
Otherwise, who knows when we’ll meet again ?

223
00:14:08,480 --> 00:14:10,170
Teng Family City ?

224
00:14:10,560 --> 00:14:12,930
The Teng Family is a cultivation family

225
00:14:12,680 --> 00:14:14,770
with a Nascent Soul Ancestor.

226
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:16,890
No one in Zhao dares to provoke them.

227
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,380
Fighting is forbidden inside the city.

228
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:20,560
Outsiders can enter by paying a few spirit stones

229
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,760
and settle here.

230
00:14:22,640 --> 00:14:23,720
Even Old Man Ji Mo

231
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:26,920
wouldn't dare to cause a ruckus here.

232
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,320
Foundation Establishment...

233
00:14:41,960 --> 00:14:43,150
Stay away,

234
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:44,850
he's from the Corpse Sect.

235
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,410
The Corpse Sect ?

236
00:14:46,720 --> 00:14:49,320
The Corpse Sect is present everywhere.

237
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:51,600
Every cultivation country,

238
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:52,720
has one branch of it.

239
00:14:53,880 --> 00:14:54,920
Come in.

240
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:59,170
The coffin contains a Corpse Puppet,

241
00:15:00,480 --> 00:15:02,480
a puppet refined from a corpse.

242
00:15:02,880 --> 00:15:05,050
It's the secret technique of their sect.

243
00:15:05,160 --> 00:15:07,170
The higher the disciple’s cultivation,

244
00:15:06,920 --> 00:15:08,570
the stronger the Corpse Puppet.

245
00:15:08,360 --> 00:15:09,520
Please come in.

246
00:15:09,440 --> 00:15:11,640
What brings you here this time ?

247
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:14,240
Stay away from them in the future,

248
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,200
the Corpse Sect is evil.

249
00:15:16,560 --> 00:15:18,640
Fellow cultivator, come take a look !

250
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:26,250
Inn
Teng Family City

251
00:15:32,960 --> 00:15:34,570
It's trying to escape !?

252
00:16:03,760 --> 00:16:05,770
Artifacts with a spirit

253
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:07,290
really are different.

254
00:16:09,160 --> 00:16:10,490
Senior,

255
00:16:10,280 --> 00:16:12,680
is there a way for me to refine it quickly ?

256
00:16:13,360 --> 00:16:14,840
I have a method

257
00:16:14,880 --> 00:16:16,440
but you won't dare to use it.

258
00:16:16,280 --> 00:16:17,320
Why ?

259
00:16:17,560 --> 00:16:19,800
It’s called Blood Refining.

260
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:22,810
You need to use your Soul Blood to refine it.

261
00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:26,440
The upside is that the sword will be yours instantly.

262
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,690
The downside however...

263
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:31,800
is that if the sword is damaged, you also will be.

264
00:16:32,120 --> 00:16:36,720
The backlash will be far worse than with regular methods.

265
00:16:36,720 --> 00:16:37,800
I’ll do it.

266
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,080
Please teach me, Senior.

267
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:40,170
Oh ?

268
00:16:39,960 --> 00:16:42,090
You’re quite ruthless on yourself.

269
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:44,850
If you used this ruthlessness on others,

270
00:16:44,640 --> 00:16:46,730
you'd already be Foundation Establishment.

271
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:47,480
Wang Lin,

272
00:16:47,720 --> 00:16:50,450
are you sure you won’t come with me to sell the ginseng ?

273
00:16:50,280 --> 00:16:51,320
I’m busy,

274
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,760
go without me.

275
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:02,370
Residence of the Ancestor
Teng Family City

276
00:17:03,560 --> 00:17:05,640
This is a small token of my respect.

277
00:17:05,480 --> 00:17:07,970
I hope Ancestor Teng will help me.

278
00:17:05,640 --> 00:17:07,810
Old Man Ji Mo
Rogue cultivator
Early stage Core Formation

279
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,250
That's good stuff.

280
00:17:12,280 --> 00:17:15,800
But I am the one who forbade fighting inside the city.

281
00:17:15,920 --> 00:17:18,170
This puts me in a difficult position.

282
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:19,280
But...

283
00:17:19,320 --> 00:17:20,360
this...

284
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:18,010
Teng Huayuan
Teng Family Ancestor
Early stage Nascent Soul

285
00:17:24,160 --> 00:17:26,970
Teng Li
Young Master of The Teng Family
Late stage Foundation Establishment

286
00:17:24,280 --> 00:17:25,880
Forgive me.

287
00:17:25,640 --> 00:17:28,800
This is my grandson, Teng Li.

288
00:17:33,720 --> 00:17:35,680
Li'er pays respects to Grandfather.

289
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:41,960
Well done.

290
00:17:42,680 --> 00:17:44,680
I present to you Old Man Ji Mo,

291
00:17:44,840 --> 00:17:47,440
he's here today to ask for our help.

292
00:17:48,200 --> 00:17:50,610
This Nascent Soul artifact

293
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:53,680
isn't meant for a Foundation Establishment...

294
00:17:53,720 --> 00:17:55,530
What are you implying ?

295
00:17:55,320 --> 00:17:58,810
That I, Teng Li, am unworthy of this Nascent Soul artifact ?

296
00:17:58,760 --> 00:17:59,400
Hmph !

297
00:17:59,640 --> 00:18:01,600
Then let me show you.

298
00:18:28,680 --> 00:18:30,000
Look, what’s that ?

299
00:18:29,760 --> 00:18:31,040
The clouds have been torn open !

300
00:18:38,840 --> 00:18:41,720
Young Master, please avenge my disciple.

301
00:18:50,280 --> 00:20:52,370
The Soul Blood is the most important part of a cultivator's soul. Destroying someone's Soul Blood instantly collapses that person's soul. Unless it is willingly given to someone, cultivators will always keep it safely inside their soul. This is why using it in blood refining is dangerous and has consequences if the blood refined artifact is damaged or destroyed.

Artifacts can house a spirit, making them sentient. In the case of a sword, the spirit will be referred to as a Sword Spirit. That's the case of Wang Lin's new sword.

A rogue cultivator is a cultivator without a sect (Wang Lin is a rogue since he lost his sect).

Spirit stones are the money used by cultivators. They're basically a crystalized form of spiritual energy that is naturally formed in areas dense in spiritual energy known as Spirit Veins. The energy from a spirit stone can thus be absorbed to heal, to cultivate, to power a formation, etc... There are grades of spirit stones depending on the density of spiritual energy inside it.

'er at the end of a name is the equivalent of an affective nickname. Here Teng Li refers to himself as "Li'er" when talking to Teng Huayuan because his grandfather calls him "Li'er".

302
00:18:55,800 --> 00:19:01,690
I've been walking this path for endless years

303
00:18:58,450 --> 00:19:01,690
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

304
00:19:02,080 --> 00:19:07,290
Is it the compass of fate

305
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:07,290
that wrote this outcome for us ?

306
00:19:07,200 --> 00:19:13,210
The heavens want to erase your existence,

307
00:19:13,080 --> 00:19:18,930
that's the obsession guiding me.

308
00:19:18,960 --> 00:19:24,530
Is this the path to uncover

309
00:19:20,840 --> 00:19:24,530
truths from falsehoods ?

310
00:19:24,560 --> 00:19:30,130
In a world of murk and shadow,

311
00:19:26,460 --> 00:19:30,130
only the flame of truth can light the way.

312
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:35,850
Look at them all,

313
00:19:32,800 --> 00:19:35,850
being carried by the waves.

314
00:19:36,040 --> 00:19:40,490
Look at them all,

315
00:19:38,200 --> 00:19:40,490
being drowned.

316
00:19:40,320 --> 00:19:43,810
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

317
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:46,890
I will let the world refine my soul.

318
00:19:46,770 --> 00:19:52,450
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

319
00:19:48,460 --> 00:19:52,450
I will fight.

320
00:19:52,200 --> 00:19:55,570
I'll break through the abyss of despair

321
00:19:55,320 --> 00:19:58,610
to finally learn who I really am.

322
00:19:58,360 --> 00:20:03,970
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

323
00:20:00,240 --> 00:20:03,970
I embrace this obsession.

324
00:20:03,720 --> 00:20:06,930
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

325
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:09,730
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

326
00:20:09,480 --> 00:20:15,210
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

327
00:20:11,520 --> 00:20:15,210
I'll still fight.

328
00:20:15,160 --> 00:20:18,570
It's hard to avoid loneliness

329
00:20:18,320 --> 00:20:21,610
when you are above everyone else.

330
00:20:21,360 --> 00:20:27,290
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

331
00:20:23,680 --> 00:20:27,290
be afraid of a firefly ?
